    action: "Start a family story practice this quarter: one intergenerational story at each Sunday meal (how grandparents met, a family setback and how it was survived), one photo-and-caption page a month in a shared album, and one yearly ritual you never cancel. Give the 20 'Do You Know?' questions to your kids once a year and fill the gaps.",
