    action: "Decide today that hitting is off the table, tell your co-parent and your children, and replace it with one pre-planned consequence ladder (warning, brief time-out or loss of privilege) written on the fridge. If you find yourself unable to keep the rule, that is the signal to enrol in a parent-training group (8111).",
